    "body": "In RDR shops, stop the mouse wheel from changing the selected item. Use the wheel to decrease or increase the current purchase or sale quantity. Preserve keyboard and controller behavior. The input must be disabled before the wheel edge reaches the vanilla list, then read through the disabled-control path if RDR uses the same control model. Acceptance: the highlighted item stays fixed while scrolling and only the quantity changes within valid bounds.",
